//
// MAIN
//

//each voice config must have a 0 category set in order to display the initial voice chat menu

voiceCategory 0

voiceMore 1 "Observation" 1
voiceMore 2 "Basic" 2
voiceMore 3 "Tactics" 3
voiceMore 4 "Offense" 4
voiceMore 5 "Defense" 5
voiceMore 6 "Battle Report" 6
voiceMore 7 "Global" 7



